    "description": "The latest version of the live broadcast application for matches.. The original BeIN Sports channels application - Live Matches is the best live broadcast application for watching all football matches for free without interruption.\r\n\r\nNow with the BeIN Sports Channels application - mobaryat live matches, you will be able to follow all international and local matches live without interruption.\r\nIn addition to watching summaries and highlights of the match after the match... as well as knowing the details and events of the match.\r\n\r\nThis application is the best as it works on the lowest internet speed and with the highest quality to ensure the best viewing of football matches.\r\n\r\nAs well as the old live broadcast program for matches, it contains a special section for the latest news related to football from various sources such as (Yalla Shoot Live, Yalla Kora, Legend News, Hi Kora, Kora Online, in the Joule, Mobi Kora), where you can activate the notifications feature and get The latest news about all your favorite teams and players.\r\n\r\nIt is a sports application that displays details of matches in all European and international championships (English League, Italian League, Spanish League, German League, ...) and local and Arab tournaments such as (Egyptian League, Moroccan League, Algerian League, Saudi League, ...) .\r\n\r\nQuickly, do not miss a single moment in following the strongest matches through this most wonderful application. You will never regret it after downloading it through our application, the latest live matches.\r\nFollow football matches live through the BeIN Sports channels application - Live Matches, the latest version, at home. Download the program now and share it with friends.",
